sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reader
    participant Web as apps/web
    participant Blog as blog.routes
    participant Catalog as catalog

    Reader->>Web: GET /{locale}/blog/{slug}
    Web->>Blog: GET /api/v1/blog/{slug}
    Blog-->>Web: PostDetailOut (published only)
    opt show_buy_card
        Web->>Catalog: GET /catalog/brands/{primary}
        Catalog-->>Web: BrandDetail
    end
    Web-->>Reader: HTML + JSON-LD + live Offer on the card
    Reader->>Web: article mount (no login)
    Web->>Blog: POST /api/v1/blog/{slug}/view
    Blog-->>Web: counts + yp_blog_reader cookie
    opt like / unlike
        Reader->>Web: like button
        Web->>Blog: POST|DELETE /api/v1/blog/{slug}/like
        Blog-->>Web: liked + counts
    end
